      "writtenOn": "2024-09-20T17:43:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done, but only added the assert in `ValidateCanUseAs` for `TextureView`. The one for TextureBase ended up needing pretty much every usage bit for validating PLS and CopyTextureForBrowser.\n\nI think we may want to consider removing the function overloading for `ValidateCanUseAs`. To add usage here I had to rename the `TextureBase` version of `ValidateCanUseAs` to find all the places it was used and update them. I still ended up missing one and caught it in tests.",
      "parentUuid": "47ea9d6c_9379a31f",
      "revId": "cd7d35f0da0138220c3ad2379d8c99e61eb964be",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
