      "writtenOn": "2024-09-20T09:08:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why do we need to validate the `inheritedUsages` against the parent texture\u0027s dimension? Since `inheritedUsages` is a subset of `texture-\u003eGetUsage()`, this validation should have already been done as part of the texture creation validation.\n\nAh it\u0027s because what we are really validating is that the usages work with the format.",
      "revId": "cd7d35f0da0138220c3ad2379d8c99e61eb964be",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
