      "side": 1,
      "message": "optional-nit: Would it be sufficient to copy over the internal usages from the parent texture? It\u0027s a bit more usages than strictly needed but doesn\u0027t seem like a terrible pessimization.",
      "revId": "cd7d35f0da0138220c3ad2379d8c99e61eb964be",
