      "writtenOn": "2024-09-20T17:43:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we don\u0027t want to copy from the parent texture here since the parent texture\u0027s internal usages are a superset of the parent texture\u0027s usage. The view\u0027s practical usages would always match the parent texture defeating the purpose of the feature.",
